<title>USA: Mills &amp; Partners acquires Circo Craft.</title>
<headline>Mills &amp; Partners acquires Circo Craft.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mills &amp; Partners Inc said Tuesday it completed its acqusition of Circo Craft Co Inc, a Montreal-based circuit board maker, for $130 million (C$180 million).</p>
<p>Mills &amp; Partners specializes in the acquisition and operation of commercial and industrial companies.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
